WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.338
<b><font color="#909090">^.^.^.^.subtitles by.^.^.^.^</font></b>
<b><font color="#804040">®</font></b> <b><font color=#ff0000>Sud_Arun collections</font></b> <b><font color="#804040">®</font>

1
00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.138
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>This is my favorite room.</i></font>

2
00:00:56.932 --> 00:00:58.400
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Most days I love it,</i></font>

3
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:02.650
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>because I can imagine the glass
falling away and I'm outside.</i></font>

4
00:01:04.815 --> 00:01:05.907
<font color="#FA6745">(GASPS)</font>

5
00:01:55.616 --> 00:01:57.789
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I don't leave my house.</i></font>

6
00:01:57.993 --> 00:02:01.372
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I haven't left my house in 17 years.</i></font>

7
00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:04.337
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>If I went outside, I'd die.</i></font>

8
00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:05.884
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Sorry to sound morose.</i></font>

9
00:02:08.462 --> 00:02:11.432
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Irradiators sterilize my clothes.</i></font>

10
00:02:12.924 --> 00:02:15.723
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I own 100 white T-shirts.</i></font>

11
00:02:15.927 --> 00:02:18.225
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>It's my standard uniform.</i></font>

12
00:02:19.514 --> 00:02:22.438
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>The airlock is a sealed room
surrounding the front door.</i></font>

13
00:02:22.643 --> 00:02:23.895
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>It's airtight.</i></font>

14
00:02:24.102 --> 00:02:26.901
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Nothing can leak into
the house when the door's open.</i></font>

15
00:02:27.648 --> 00:02:30.026
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>It's not that I don't want to go outside.</i></font>

16
00:02:30.233 --> 00:02:31.234
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I can't.</i></font>

17
00:02:31.443 --> 00:02:35.493
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Simple viruses can kill me.
It's like I'm allergic to everything.</i></font>

18
00:02:35.697 --> 00:02:39.418
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>What I eat, what I touch,
they all have consequences.</i></font>

19
00:02:40.243 --> 00:02:42.746
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I have severe combined immunodeficiency.</i></font>

20
00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.172
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>My immune system sucks.</i></font>

21
00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:46.758
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Here's a drawing to explain.</i></font>

22
00:02:46.917 --> 00:02:50.091
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>In every drop of blood there are
special cells called lymphocytes.</i></font>

23
00:02:50.295 --> 00:02:51.296
<font color="#ff8000">LYMPHOCYTE 1</font> : Hello.

24
00:02:51.505 --> 00:02:54.850
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Some of these lymphocytes
are really good at fighting bad guys,</i></font>

25
00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:57.269
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>- like viruses and bacteria.</i></font>
- <font color="#FA6745">(LYMPHOCYTE 1 LAUGHING)</font>

26
00:02:57.469 --> 00:02:58.937
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>But I have SCID,</i></font>

27
00:02:59.137 --> 00:03:01.217
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>which means I have way fewer
lymphocytes than normal.</i></font>

28
00:03:01.264 --> 00:03:02.700
- <font color="#ff8000">LYMPHOCYTE 1</font> : Uh-Oh.
- <font color="#FA6745">(LYMPHOCYTE 2 EXCLAIMS)</font>

29
00:03:02.724 --> 00:03:04.146
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>And the ones that I do have,</i></font>

30
00:03:04.309 --> 00:03:05.310
<font color="#FA6745">(LYMPHOCYTE 1 GROANING)</font>

31
00:03:05.477 --> 00:03:07.400
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>well, they're not so good at fighting.</i></font>

32
00:03:09.398 --> 00:03:11.742
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>My mom made me join a support group.</i></font>

33
00:03:12.693 --> 00:03:14.946
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Some of them are really sick.</i></font>

34
00:03:15.153 --> 00:03:17.781
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Others have a hard time
with social interactions.</i></font>

35
00:03:19.491 --> 00:03:20.651
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>At least I have the Internet.</i></font>

36
00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.581
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I exercise.</i></font>

37
00:03:25.789 --> 00:03:27.336
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I read a lot of books.</i></font>

38
00:03:28.291 --> 00:03:29.793
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>When I'm done, I write short reviews.</i></font>

39
00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:43.015
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I take an architecture class online.</i></font>

40
00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.520
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Whenever I make a new model,
I put an astronaut inside.</i></font>

41
00:03:48.937 --> 00:03:50.610
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I can relate to him.</i></font>

42
00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:54.368
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I feel like an astronaut,
stranded in space.</i></font>

43
00:04:04.411 --> 00:04:07.164
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Every day feels exactly the same.</i></font>

44
00:04:16.757 --> 00:04:18.430
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Maybe today's different.</i></font>

45
00:04:19.342 --> 00:04:20.502
<font color="#ff8000">JOE</font> : Get off the truck, Olly.

46
00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:42.992
<font color="#FA6745">(QUIETLY)</font> Hi.

47
00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:02.899
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>If you're going to have an illness</i></font>

48
00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:06.394
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>that requires someone to constantly
watch if you're still breathing,</i></font>

49
00:05:06.598 --> 00:05:08.896
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>it's convenient for
your mother to be a doctor.</i></font>

50
00:05:10.519 --> 00:05:13.113
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I was diagnosed with SCID pretty early.</i></font>

51
00:05:13.855 --> 00:05:16.535
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>My mom figured out what was wrong
with me after eight ear infections</i></font>

52
00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:17.902
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>and two cases of pneumonia.</i></font>

53
00:05:19.069 --> 00:05:20.549
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I couldn't gain any weight as a baby.</i></font>

54
00:05:20.695 --> 00:05:21.742
<font color="#FA6745">(CELL PHONE VIBRATING)</font>

55
00:05:22.113 --> 00:05:24.832
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Most kids don't make it
past two years old.</i></font>

56
00:05:25.909 --> 00:05:27.035
Doctor Whittier.

57
00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.547
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Today's my birthday.</i></font>

58
00:05:37.295 --> 00:05:38.296
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I'm 18.</i></font>

59
00:05:41.091 --> 00:05:42.092
<font color="#FA6745">(BEEPS)</font>

60
00:05:42.259 --> 00:05:44.136
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Which means nothing inside here.</i></font>

61
00:05:46.263 --> 00:05:47.389
<font color="#FA6745">(BEEPING)</font>

62
00:05:49.516 --> 00:05:52.110
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>This is the face
her patients normally see,</i></font>

63
00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.903
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>slightly distant, concerned.</i></font>

64
00:05:55.438 --> 00:05:57.736
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I wonder if they find it comforting.</i></font>

65
00:05:57.941 --> 00:05:59.318
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I do.</i></font>

66
00:05:59.943 --> 00:06:01.490
You didn't have to take the day off.

67
00:06:01.695 --> 00:06:03.789
I always take the day off.

68
00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:05.866
What do you want to do today?

69
00:06:06.324 --> 00:06:08.452
Same thing we always do.

70
00:06:19.296 --> 00:06:20.764
Spatlit...

71
00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:22.682
What does that say?

72
00:06:22.883 --> 00:06:25.102
- <font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font> Spotlight.
- <font color="#FA6745">(LAUGHING)</font> No, it doesn't.

73
00:06:25.302 --> 00:06:26.863
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>You're not good
at phonetic Scrabble.</i></font>

74
00:06:26.887 --> 00:06:28.685
<font color="#ff8000">PAULINE</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Because it
doesn't make any sense.</i></font>

75
00:06:28.889 --> 00:06:30.607
You're the one who always wants to play.

76
00:06:30.807 --> 00:06:32.980
It was your dad's favorite game.

77
00:06:33.727 --> 00:06:34.979
Did he beat you, too?

78
00:06:35.186 --> 00:06:36.358
Yeah.

79
00:06:36.563 --> 00:06:38.406
But he let me win sometimes.

80
00:06:38.607 --> 00:06:40.655
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>- I can't do that.
- Why not?</i></font>

81
00:06:40.859 --> 00:06:42.486
<font color="#FA6745">(SIGHS)</font> <font color="#FFFF00"><i>I'm in love with you.</i></font>

82
00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:44.408
<font color="#FA6745">(PAULINE AND MADDY CHUCKLING)</font>

83
00:06:46.156 --> 00:06:47.328
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Snap out of it!</i></font>

84
00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:48.610
- <font color="#FA6745">(DOORBELL RINGS)</font>
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>- I can't.</i></font>

85
00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:49.952
I'll get it.

86
00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.787
- Stay here.
- <font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

87
00:06:54.873 --> 00:06:56.309
<font color="#ff8000">WOMAN</font> : <font color="#FA6745">(ON TV)</font> <font color="#FFFF00"><i>And you
won't come to the wedding.</i></font>

88
00:06:56.333 --> 00:06:57.518
<font color="#ff8000">MAN</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>I'll come to the wedding.</i></font>

89
00:06:57.542 --> 00:06:59.510
<font color="#ff8000">WOMAN</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>I am telling you, you can't come.</i></font>

90
00:07:01.671 --> 00:07:02.672
<font color="#FA6745">(DOOR LOCK BEEPS)</font>

91
00:07:08.136 --> 00:07:09.934
- <font color="#FA6745">(DOOR LOCK BEEPS)</font>
- <font color="#FA6745">(DOOR OPENS)</font>

92
00:07:19.064 --> 00:07:20.111
<font color="#FA6745">(DOOR LOCK BEEPS)</font>

93
00:07:22.525 --> 00:07:23.526
Hi.

94
00:07:24.027 --> 00:07:26.826
Um, my mom sent a Bundt.
It's not very good.

95
00:07:28.531 --> 00:07:31.705
It's kind of a thing our mom does
every time we move in somewhere.

96
00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:33.750
She'll make us bring one
to the neighbor, so...

97
00:07:34.996 --> 00:07:38.876
It's actually more of, uh, an apology
than an introduction. <font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

98
00:07:39.376 --> 00:07:41.549
What's she apologizing for?

99
00:07:41.753 --> 00:07:43.596
For moving in.

100
00:07:44.589 --> 00:07:46.808
<font color="#FA6745">(STUTTERING)</font> Oh, that's nice.

101
00:07:50.178 --> 00:07:52.806
Actually, I can't accept that.

102
00:07:53.056 --> 00:07:54.057
Why not?

103
00:07:54.265 --> 00:07:55.983
It's complicated.

104
00:07:56.184 --> 00:07:58.653
But please thank your mother for me,

105
00:07:58.853 --> 00:08:01.447
and welcome to the neighborhood.

106
00:08:02.399 --> 00:08:03.616
Is your daughter around?

107
00:08:06.444 --> 00:08:08.287
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>So, that's why you came.</i></font>

108
00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:10.466
- <font color="#ff8000">OLLY</font> : That's not why I came.
- <font color="#ff8000">KAYRA</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Yeah, it is. Yep.</i></font>

109
00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:11.867
No, she isn't.

110
00:08:12.909 --> 00:08:14.126
<font color="#FA6745">(DOOR LOCK BEEPS)</font>

111
00:08:17.998 --> 00:08:19.295
<font color="#FA6745">(BOTH SNICKERING)</font>

112
00:08:21.418 --> 00:08:22.715
You take the Bundt next time.

113
00:08:22.919 --> 00:08:24.592
<font color="#ff8000">KAYRA</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Oh, right. Wear it as a hat.</i></font>

114
00:08:27.048 --> 00:08:28.516
<font color="#FA6745">(KAYRA AND OLLY LAUGHING)</font>

115
00:08:30.051 --> 00:08:31.052
<font color="#FA6745">(GLASS SHATTERS)</font>

116
00:08:31.261 --> 00:08:32.638
<font color="#ff8000">JOE</font> : Watch it.

117
00:08:42.605 --> 00:08:43.948
<font color="#FA6745">(ENGINE STARTING)</font>

118
00:09:18.475 --> 00:09:20.944
<font color="#ff8000">PAULINE</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Madeline, do you want
to finish the movie?</i></font>

119
00:09:23.354 --> 00:09:26.733
I'd rather know
what a Bundt cake tastes like.

120
00:09:26.941 --> 00:09:28.158
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>It's dry.</i></font>

121
00:09:28.359 --> 00:09:30.782
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>You're not missing out on anything.</i></font>

122
00:09:31.154 --> 00:09:33.077
<font color="#FA6745">(IN LOW VOICE)</font> No, just everything.

123
00:09:36.117 --> 00:09:38.916
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>There's a short list of people
that know I'm alive.</i></font>

124
00:09:39.996 --> 00:09:44.172
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>My mom, my nurse, Carla,
and her daughter, Rosa.</i></font>

125
00:09:45.752 --> 00:09:48.676
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I can't remember Carla not being with us.</i></font>

126
00:09:49.047 --> 00:09:51.846
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>She's been working here for 15 years.</i></font>

127
00:09:52.926 --> 00:09:56.976
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Sometimes, I think she's trapped
inside here with me.</i></font>

128
00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:10.902
- Morning, Carla.
- Mmm-hmm.

129
00:10:21.579 --> 00:10:23.832
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>- Feliz cumpleaños.</i></font>
- <font color="#FA6745">(BOTH CHUCKLE)</font>

130
00:10:23.998 --> 00:10:25.966
- Thank you!
- <font color="#FA6745">(SPEAKS SPANISH)</font>

131
00:10:26.209 --> 00:10:28.086
Thank you so much.

132
00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:30.467
<font color="#FA6745">(SPEAKS SPANISH)</font>

133
00:10:30.713 --> 00:10:31.930
- Ooh, <font color="#FFFF00"><i>una nota.</i></font>
- <font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

134
00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:33.807
<font color="#FA6745">(CLICKING)</font>

135
00:10:36.094 --> 00:10:37.687
<font color="#FA6745">(CLICKING CONTINUES INTERMITTENTLY)</font>

136
00:11:03.413 --> 00:11:04.414
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

137
00:11:14.382 --> 00:11:15.383
<font color="#FA6745">(INTERMITTENT CLICKING)</font>

138
00:11:32.567 --> 00:11:33.568
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

139
00:11:38.031 --> 00:11:39.499
<font color="#FA6745">(SOFTLY)</font> That's terrible.

140
00:11:47.999 --> 00:11:49.546
<font color="#FA6745">(INTERMITTENT CLICKING)</font>

141
00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:00.011
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

142
00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:12.152
<font color="#FA6745">(LAUGHS)</font>

143
00:12:43.346 --> 00:12:44.347
<font color="#FA6745">(CELL PHONE CHIMES)</font>

144
00:12:45.848 --> 00:12:47.395
<font color="#FA6745">(CELL PHONES CONTINUE CHIMING)</font>

145
00:12:57.527 --> 00:12:59.279
<font color="#FA6745">(MOUTHING)</font> Hi, Olly.

146
00:13:00.363 --> 00:13:01.706
<font color="#FA6745">(MOUTHING)</font> Hi, Maddy.

147
00:13:12.625 --> 00:13:16.175
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>I tell myself I won't text back
immediately when Olly texts me.</i></font>

148
00:13:16.337 --> 00:13:17.338
<font color="#FA6745">(CELL PHONE CHIMES)</font>

149
00:13:17.797 --> 00:13:21.392
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>And then I text back. Immediately.</i></font>

150
00:13:31.894 --> 00:13:33.237
Are you on house arrest?

151
00:13:33.396 --> 00:13:34.581
Why do you think I'm on house arrest?

152
00:13:34.605 --> 00:13:36.709
'Cause I haven't seen you outside once
since we got here.

153
00:13:36.733 --> 00:13:37.734
Um... <font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

154
00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.119
I'm not on house arrest,
but I can't leave the house.

155
00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.572
Very mysterious.

156
00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.327
Are you a ghost?

157
00:13:43.573 --> 00:13:46.385
'Cause, it would just my luck that
the girl next door is not actually alive.

158
00:13:46.409 --> 00:13:49.037
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLING)</font> I'm, like,
98% sure that I'm alive.

159
00:13:49.245 --> 00:13:50.246
Hmm.

160
00:13:50.413 --> 00:13:52.293
So, what is it? Is it a guy?
Are you knocked up?

161
00:13:52.415 --> 00:13:55.259
Oh, my God. Well, what if I was?

162
00:13:56.044 --> 00:13:57.204
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font> I'd be conflicted.

163
00:13:57.337 --> 00:13:58.429
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font> About what?

164
00:13:59.422 --> 00:14:00.423
Do you have a boyfriend?

165
00:14:01.007 --> 00:14:03.726
No. I don't have a boyfriend,
and I'm not pregnant.

166
00:14:03.926 --> 00:14:06.020
Have you spent all day
thinking that I was pregnant?

167
00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:07.267
Yeah, kind of.

168
00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:10.200
I mean, it would have been awkward
flirting with a pregnant girl, so...

169
00:14:10.224 --> 00:14:12.443
Right. <font color="#FA6745">(LAUGHS)</font>

170
00:14:13.061 --> 00:14:14.781
Don't you wanna know
if I have a girlfriend?

171
00:14:16.022 --> 00:14:17.069
No.

172
00:14:18.066 --> 00:14:19.318
I'm hurt.

173
00:14:19.525 --> 00:14:21.277
- I mean, that stings.
- <font color="#FA6745">(MADDY CHUCKLES)</font>

174
00:14:21.736 --> 00:14:22.976
So, where'd you move here from?

175
00:14:23.071 --> 00:14:24.948
Boston, but I'm from New York.

176
00:14:25.656 --> 00:14:27.624
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I wanna move back.</i></font>

177
00:14:29.327 --> 00:14:32.171
I always imagined myself
working in a bakery in New York.

178
00:14:32.372 --> 00:14:35.000
You know, like Nicolas Cage
in that movie, <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Moonstruck?</i></font>

179
00:14:35.208 --> 00:14:36.255
No.

180
00:14:36.542 --> 00:14:37.543
"Snap out of it!"

181
00:14:41.172 --> 00:14:42.424
It's from the movie.

182
00:14:43.049 --> 00:14:44.596
Yeah, I figured.

183
00:14:46.094 --> 00:14:48.188
<font color="#ff8000">OLLY</font> : All right, here's a game.
Fast Five Favorites.

184
00:14:48.388 --> 00:14:49.435
- Okay?
- <font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : Okay.

185
00:14:49.639 --> 00:14:53.189
So, book, word, color, vice, person.

186
00:14:53.726 --> 00:14:56.149
Um... <font color="#FA6745">(SIGHS)</font> Okay. All right. Um...

187
00:14:56.437 --> 00:14:57.438
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>So, I guess...</i></font>

188
00:14:57.647 --> 00:14:59.208
Come on. Type faster.
Don't think about it.

189
00:14:59.232 --> 00:15:01.155
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font> Okay. All right.
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>The Little Prince.</i></font>

190
00:15:01.359 --> 00:15:02.656
- Uxorious.
- Ooh.

191
00:15:02.985 --> 00:15:04.612
- Aquamarine.
- Hmm.

192
00:15:05.905 --> 00:15:08.078
I don't have any vices.

193
00:15:08.282 --> 00:15:09.659
And my mom.

194
00:15:09.826 --> 00:15:11.106
Oh, come on. Everyone has vices.

195
00:15:11.244 --> 00:15:12.336
How many vices do you have?

196
00:15:12.495 --> 00:15:13.667
