- <font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

201
00:15:21.003 --> 00:15:22.505
Uh, petty theft.

202
00:15:22.672 --> 00:15:24.925
And my sister.

203
00:15:25.341 --> 00:15:26.638
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Lord of the Flies?</i></font>

204
00:15:26.843 --> 00:15:28.641
