238
00:16:52.094 --> 00:16:53.186
Good. <font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

239
00:17:00.937 --> 00:17:03.110
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I wish I could meet you in person.</i></font>

240
00:17:04.815 --> 00:17:06.362
