265
00:19:19.533 --> 00:19:20.534
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Huh.</i></font>

266
00:19:21.369 --> 00:19:22.916
Teenagers are all the same.

267
00:19:23.079 --> 00:19:24.706
Is that a no?

268
