281
00:20:05.538 --> 00:20:06.539
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

282
00:20:06.997 --> 00:20:07.998
<font color="#FA6745">(DOORBELL RINGS)</font>

283
00:20:08.249 --> 00:20:10.060
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Rosa's the only other person
