300
00:21:02.094 --> 00:21:03.311
<font color="#FA6745">(KNOCKING ON GLASS)</font>

301
00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:15.991
<font color="#ff8000">AUTOMATED VOICE</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Connected
to Oliver Bright's iPhone.</i></font>

302
00:21:47.389 --> 00:21:48.686
