326
00:23:45.841 --> 00:23:46.842
Olly.

327
00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:48.761
<font color="#FA6745">(GASPS)</font>

328
00:23:50.846 --> 00:23:51.972
<font color="#FA6745">(GRUNTS SOFTLY)</font>

329
00:23:53.515 --> 00:23:54.687
