367
00:26:17.743 --> 00:26:19.183
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font> Yeah, that's a good idea.

368
00:26:20.079 --> 00:26:21.547
Have you ever left this house?

369
00:26:22.498 --> 00:26:23.545
Uh, no.

370
00:26:25.793 --> 00:26:27.511
