376
00:26:40.682 --> 00:26:42.355
And I've never seen it.

377
00:26:42.643 --> 00:26:44.361
<font color="#FA6745">(INHALES SHARPLY)</font> It's a bad choice.

378
00:26:44.686 --> 00:26:45.687
