390
00:27:14.716 --> 00:27:15.968
Yeah, well...

391
00:27:17.594 --> 00:27:18.595
<font color="#FA6745">(SIGHS)</font>

392
00:27:23.725 --> 00:27:25.227
<font color="#FA6745">(BOTH CHUCKLE NERVOUSLY)</font>

393
00:27:30.357 --> 00:27:31.950
I'm really good at handstands.

394
00:27:32.568 --> 00:27:33.990
Yeah?

395
00:27:39.074 --> 00:27:40.246
<font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

396
00:27:42.536 --> 00:27:43.583
What else can you do?

397
00:27:43.787 --> 00:27:45.084
Oh, man.

398
00:27:45.247 --> 00:27:47.875
I'm afraid that's pretty much it.

399
00:28:08.103 --> 00:28:09.696
You didn't touch, right?

400
00:28:09.897 --> 00:28:11.114
<font color="#ff8000">BOTH</font> : No.

401
00:28:11.648 --> 00:28:12.865
No touching.

402
00:28:17.529 --> 00:28:18.530
<font color="#FA6745">(CARLA SPEAKS SPANISH)</font>

403
00:28:23.076 --> 00:28:24.578
<font color="#ff8000">CARLA</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Your face!</i></font>

404
00:28:24.786 --> 00:28:26.413
