417
00:29:04.785 --> 00:29:05.786
Hmm?

418
00:29:40.028 --> 00:29:41.029
Hey, where are you?

419
00:29:41.280 --> 00:29:43.282
<font color="#ff8000">OLLY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Skating in Venice.</i></font>

420
00:29:43.532 --> 00:29:45.034
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Oh, Shit.</i></font>

421
00:29:45.701 --> 00:29:46.873
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I'm sorry, Maddy.</i></font>

422
00:29:47.035 --> 00:29:49.163
