885
01:11:02.425 --> 01:11:03.802
<font color="#ff8000">OLLY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Hey, Maddy.</i></font>

886
01:11:04.510 --> 01:11:06.353
<font color="#FA6745">(BREATH TREMBLING)</font>

887
01:11:07.054 --> 01:11:08.772
Maddy, are you okay?

888
01:11:10.641 --> 01:11:12.939
- <font color="#FA6745">(GASPING)</font>
- Maddy, what's wrong?

889
01:11:13.686 --> 01:11:15.154
Maddy, are you okay?

890
01:11:15.855 --> 01:11:18.278
Whoa! Okay. All right.

891
01:11:19.066 --> 01:11:20.192
You're burning up.

892
01:11:20.359 --> 01:11:22.487
Maddy? Maddy?

893
01:11:22.695 --> 01:11:24.255
<font color="#FA6745">(VOICE ECHOING)</font> Maddy, can you hear me?

894
01:11:26.866 --> 01:11:28.868
- <font color="#FA6745">(EKG BEEPING)</font>
- <font color="#FA6745">(MAN SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY)</font>

895
01:11:29.577 --> 01:11:30.794
<font color="#FA6745">(AMBULANCE SIREN WAILING)</font>

896
01:11:32.914 --> 01:11:33.915
Got it.

897
01:11:40.880 --> 01:11:42.257
<font color="#ff8000">PARAMEDIC</font> : Coming through.

898
01:11:42.465 --> 01:11:43.901
MALE DOCTOR:
We just gotta get her to triage.

899
01:11:43.925 --> 01:11:45.525
<font color="#ff8000">FEMALE DOCTOR</font> : Let's take her to Exam 2.

900
01:11:47.386 --> 01:11:48.808
<font color="#FA6745">(EKG BEEPING)</font>

901
01:11:51.140 --> 01:11:52.562
<font color="#FA6745">(DOOR OPENS)</font>

902
01:12:07.114 --> 01:12:08.912
<font color="#ff8000">DR. FRANCIS</font> : Could you give us a minute?

903
01:12:18.543 --> 01:12:20.090
<font color="#FA6745">(SOFTLY)</font> Madeline?

904
01:12:20.545 --> 01:12:21.967
<font color="#FA6745">(IN NORMAL VOICE)</font> Madeline?

905
01:12:50.783 --> 01:12:52.456
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>My heart stopped.</i></font>

906
01:12:52.618 --> 01:12:53.619
<font color="#FA6745">(GASPS)</font>

907
01:12:55.121 --> 01:12:57.294
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Then it started again.</i></font>

908
01:12:58.124 --> 01:12:59.967
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>When I woke up,</i></font>

909
01:13:00.793 --> 01:13:02.511
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>he was gone.</i></font>

910
01:13:10.970 --> 01:13:12.813
<font color="#ff8000">PAULINE</font> : No, no, no. Lie down.

911
01:13:12.972 --> 01:13:14.815
Lie down, honey.

912
01:13:16.893 --> 01:13:17.940
<font color="#FA6745">(SOFTLY)</font> Lie down.

913
01:13:19.729 --> 01:13:21.402
Am I okay?

914
01:13:21.606 --> 01:13:22.778
You're going to be.

915
01:14:06.317 --> 01:14:07.318
<font color="#ff8000">OLLY</font> : Are you okay?

916
01:14:07.526 --> 01:14:08.527
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : Yes.

917
01:14:09.153 --> 01:14:11.372
- Are you sure?
- Yeah. I'm okay, Olly.

918
01:14:12.531 --> 01:14:14.954
It's nice to be able
to talk to you again.

919
01:14:15.451 --> 01:14:17.795
I tried to visit,
but your mom wouldn't let me.

920
01:14:17.995 --> 01:14:20.464
Yeah, I'm sorry
I put you through all of that.

921
01:14:20.873 --> 01:14:22.375
I can't do this anymore.

922
01:14:22.541 --> 01:14:24.509
Can't do what?

923
01:14:25.378 --> 01:14:27.426
No more texts.

924
01:14:27.630 --> 01:14:28.882
No more e-mails.

925
01:14:29.048 --> 01:14:31.142
Olly, this is just too hard.

926
01:14:32.259 --> 01:14:34.762
My morn was right, life was better before.

927
01:14:34.971 --> 01:14:36.223
Better for who?

928
01:14:36.430 --> 01:14:37.477
Ellipses.

929
01:14:37.682 --> 01:14:39.355
Don't do this, Maddy.

930
01:14:41.185 --> 01:14:42.277
Ellipses.

931
01:14:42.478 --> 01:14:45.903
Look, my life is better with you in it.

932
01:14:46.065 --> 01:14:47.692
But mine isn't.

933
01:14:49.860 --> 01:14:51.487
You know, I lied before.

934
01:14:52.071 --> 01:14:53.368
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>About what?</i></font>

935
01:14:53.531 --> 01:14:55.078
I do feel sorry for you.

936
01:15:07.294 --> 01:15:09.012
<font color="#FA6745">(CRYING SOFTLY)</font>

937
01:15:20.850 --> 01:15:22.102
<font color="#ff8000">PAULINE</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Tomorrow,</i></font>

938
01:15:23.019 --> 01:15:25.147
I am back at the hospital.

939
01:15:26.022 --> 01:15:28.445
Did you find me a good babysitter?

940
01:15:29.400 --> 01:15:32.620
Actually, I've been thinking
maybe you don't need a nurse.

941
01:15:32.945 --> 01:15:35.619
You learned a tough lesson,
and I can't imagine you repeating it.

942
01:15:36.282 --> 01:15:37.499
No.

943
01:15:38.325 --> 01:15:39.542
Good.

944
01:15:59.472 --> 01:16:00.849
<font color="#FA6745">(LAPTOP CHIMES)</font>

945
01:16:22.953 --> 01:16:24.796
<font color="#FA6745">(ALARM BEEPING)</font>

946
01:16:25.831 --> 01:16:27.083
<font color="#FA6745">(DOOR CLOSES)</font>

947
01:16:44.517 --> 01:16:47.270
<font color="#ff8000">OLLY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>I wish you'd talk to me.</i></font>

948
01:16:47.478 --> 01:16:50.322
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I'll never meet anyone like you, Maddy.</i></font>

949
01:16:50.523 --> 01:16:53.527
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>You look at the ocean
like it was meant for you.</i></font>

950
01:16:54.318 --> 01:16:57.322
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>You jump off cliffs
even though you can't swim.</i></font>

951
01:16:58.197 --> 01:17:02.043
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>You think you can find
the meaning of life in a book.</i></font>

952
01:17:02.827 --> 01:17:05.171
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>You don't have any vices.</i></font>

953
01:17:05.371 --> 01:17:07.373
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>You should really get some.</i></font>

954
01:17:09.208 --> 01:17:11.711
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I'm trying not to love you.</i></font>

955
01:17:12.545 --> 01:17:14.047
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>But I'm failing.</i></font>

956
01:17:15.965 --> 01:17:17.967
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>This is my last e-mail.</i></font>

957
01:17:18.175 --> 01:17:19.927
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>We're moving back to New York.</i></font>

958
01:17:21.846 --> 01:17:25.521
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>We're leaving tonight,
when my dad's out drinking.</i></font>

959
01:17:25.683 --> 01:17:27.105
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>My mom wants to do it at night,</i></font>

960
01:17:27.268 --> 01:17:29.108
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>because she's afraid
she won't be able to do it</i></font>

961
01:17:29.145 --> 01:17:30.988
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>if he's right in front of her.</i></font>

962
01:17:32.148 --> 01:17:33.570
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I finally told her about you.</i></font>

963
01:17:35.526 --> 01:17:37.824
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>She thinks you're brave.</i></font>

964
01:17:40.614 --> 01:17:43.333
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Being with you made me brave.</i></font>

965
01:17:48.581 --> 01:17:49.582
<font color="#FA6745">(ENGINE STARTS)</font>

966
01:18:18.944 --> 01:18:20.446
<font color="#FA6745">(CELL PHONE VIBRATING)</font>

967
01:18:27.953 --> 01:18:29.170
Hello?

968
01:18:29.330 --> 01:18:31.332
- <font color="#ff8000">DR. FRANCIS</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>Madeline Whittier?</i></font>
- Yes.

969
01:18:31.582 --> 01:18:35.428
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Hi, this is Dr. Melissa Francis
from Maui Memorial Hospital.</i></font>

970
01:18:35.628 --> 01:18:38.598
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I was your attending physician
while you were here.</i></font>

971
01:18:38.797 --> 01:18:41.175
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I'm just following up
on your lab results.</i></font>

972
01:18:41.383 --> 01:18:44.683
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Your myocarditis was caused
by a viral infection.</i></font>

973
01:18:45.596 --> 01:18:48.566
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>You seem to have
a very weak immune system.</i></font>

974
01:18:48.766 --> 01:18:49.813
Well, I have SCID.

975
01:18:49.975 --> 01:18:52.854
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>SCID? Really? Why would you think that?</i></font>

976
01:18:53.062 --> 01:18:54.814
I've had it since I was a baby.

977
01:18:54.980 --> 01:18:56.020
<font color="#FA6745">(STAMMERS)</font> <font color="#FFFF00"><i>I don't know...</i></font>

978
01:18:56.148 --> 01:18:58.651
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>If you had that kind
of severe immunodeficiency,</i></font>

979
01:18:58.859 --> 01:19:01.203
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>you probably would have suffered
more than myocarditis.</i></font>

980
01:19:31.475 --> 01:19:32.897
<font color="#FA6745">(PANTING)</font>

981
01:19:38.148 --> 01:19:39.195
What's going on?

982
01:19:42.069 --> 01:19:43.571
Am I sick?

983
01:19:44.154 --> 01:19:45.201
What?

984
01:19:46.323 --> 01:19:47.996
Am I sick?

985
01:19:48.200 --> 01:19:49.952
Do you feel sick?

986
01:19:50.452 --> 01:19:51.999
That's not what I mean.

987
01:19:54.540 --> 01:19:55.632
<font color="#FA6745">(BREATHES SHAKILY)</font>

988
01:19:55.791 --> 01:19:56.838
<font color="#FA6745">(SNIFFLES)</font>

989
01:19:58.210 --> 01:20:00.963
Do you remember meeting
a Dr. Francis in Maui?

990
01:20:01.171 --> 01:20:04.266
I met lots of doctors in Maui, why?

991
01:20:05.592 --> 01:20:08.345
She doesn't think I have SCID.

992
01:20:10.306 --> 01:20:13.105
And she got your hopes up, didn't she?

993
01:20:15.394 --> 01:20:19.149
It was irresponsible of her to do that.

994
01:20:19.356 --> 01:20:21.825
S.C.I.D. is so rare

995
01:20:22.026 --> 01:20:23.778
and so complicated.

996
01:20:23.986 --> 01:20:28.036
Not everyone understands it.
There's just too many types.

997
01:20:28.365 --> 01:20:31.585
And every person reacts differently.

998
01:20:31.744 --> 01:20:32.916
You get that, don't you?

999
01:20:33.078 --> 01:20:34.751
Yeah, that's what you've always told me.

1000
01:20:34.955 --> 01:20:36.355
Well, you just saw it for yourself.

1001
01:20:36.457 --> 01:20:38.334
You were fine for a little while,

1002
01:20:38.542 --> 01:20:40.422
and then you almost died
in that emergency room.

1003
01:20:40.586 --> 01:20:44.432
Immune systems are very complicated.

1004
01:20:44.631 --> 01:20:49.057
And Dr. Francis doesn't know
your full medical history.

1005
01:20:49.261 --> 01:20:51.980
She's just looking at a tiny fraction.

1006
01:20:52.181 --> 01:20:55.276
She hasn't been here
the whole time like I have.

1007
01:20:59.521 --> 01:21:01.239
Where are the papers, Mom?

1008
01:21:02.399 --> 01:21:04.618
<font color="#FA6745">(STAMMERS)</font> What are you talking about?

1009
01:21:06.070 --> 01:21:08.448
You have records for everything.

1010
01:21:08.655 --> 01:21:10.657
But you have nothing about SCID!

1011
01:21:10.866 --> 01:21:12.083
Where are the papers?

1012
01:21:13.660 --> 01:21:16.288
<font color="#FA6745">(STAMMERING)</font> Well, they must be here,

1013
01:21:16.455 --> 01:21:18.674
because I keep...

1014
01:21:19.625 --> 01:21:22.299
I keep everything and I...

1015
01:21:23.629 --> 01:21:24.972
Did you...

1016
01:21:25.381 --> 01:21:27.429
Did you take them?

1017
01:21:27.883 --> 01:21:29.430
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>The papers?</i></font>

1018
01:21:30.886 --> 01:21:32.308
<font color="#FA6745">(BREATHING SHAKILY)</font>

1019
01:21:37.393 --> 01:21:39.020
Madeline?

1020
01:21:40.521 --> 01:21:41.864
Madeline?

1021
01:21:50.823 --> 01:21:52.370
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Madeline?</i></font>

1022
01:21:52.533 --> 01:21:54.035
Madeline?

1023
01:21:57.037 --> 01:21:59.756
Madeline, what are you doing?
Are you okay?

1024
01:21:59.998 --> 01:22:01.295
Come inside, come inside.

1025
01:22:01.500 --> 01:22:03.093
Why?

1026
01:22:04.503 --> 01:22:06.631
Why do I have to go inside, Mom?

1027
01:22:06.839 --> 01:22:09.888
Because you're sick, baby. You're sick.

1028
01:22:10.092 --> 01:22:11.218
No.

1029
01:22:11.427 --> 01:22:13.350
Madeline, please. Please.

1030
01:22:13.512 --> 01:22:14.855
I'm not going back inside.

1031
01:22:15.055 --> 01:22:16.056
You have to.

1032
01:22:17.307 --> 01:22:20.060
You're all I have left. I can't lose you.

1033
01:22:20.811 --> 01:22:22.063
<font color="#FA6745">(SOFTLY)</font> Please.

1034
01:22:22.855 --> 01:22:25.153
Have I ever been sick?

1035
01:22:28.735 --> 01:22:29.782
Come inside.

1036
01:22:29.987 --> 01:22:30.988
<font color="#FA6745">(BREATHING SHARPLY)</font>

1037
01:22:31.321 --> 01:22:32.868
Come inside.

1038
01:22:33.031 --> 01:22:35.033
Come inside, Madeline.

1039
01:22:35.200 --> 01:22:36.873
- <font color="#FA6745">(SOBS)</font>
- Madeline, don't.

1040
01:22:37.744 --> 01:22:39.166
Madeline, don't.

1041
01:22:39.371 --> 01:22:40.623
Madeline.

1042
01:22:41.123 --> 01:22:42.170
Madeline!

1043
01:22:43.083 --> 01:22:44.460
Madeline!

1044
01:22:45.002 --> 01:22:46.219
<font color="#FA6745">(PAULINE CRIES)</font>

1045
01:23:03.353 --> 01:23:04.479
<font color="#FA6745">(SHUDDERS)</font>

1046
01:23:30.255 --> 01:23:32.484
<font color="#ff8000">DR. CHASE</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>We're not sure about the state
of your immune system.</i></font>

1047
01:23:32.508 --> 01:23:37.139
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>We think it's possible that
it's underdeveloped, like an infant's.</i></font>

1048
01:23:37.930 --> 01:23:41.776
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>It hasn't been exposed to common viruses
or bacterial infections.</i></font>

1049
01:23:42.351 --> 01:23:44.228
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>You don't have S.C.I.D.</i></font>

1050
01:23:45.938 --> 01:23:47.281
Why did I get sick in Hawaii?

1051
01:23:47.481 --> 01:23:50.234
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Well, normal, healthy people
get sick all the time.</i></font>

1052
01:24:07.459 --> 01:24:08.460
<font color="#FA6745">(SIGHS)</font>

1053
01:24:12.256 --> 01:24:14.634
I brought you some of your things.

1054
01:24:21.932 --> 01:24:24.856
I'm only taking it because
I want you to leave.

1055
01:24:32.859 --> 01:24:36.033
Right after your dad
and your brother died,

1056
01:24:38.657 --> 01:24:40.830
you got so sick.

1057
01:24:42.077 --> 01:24:44.079
You wouldn't breathe right.

1058
01:24:44.997 --> 01:24:49.093
And I took you to the emergency room,
where we had to stay for three days,

1059
01:24:50.335 --> 01:24:53.259
and they couldn't figure out
what was wrong with you.

1060
01:24:54.798 --> 01:24:58.473
They said it was probably
some kind of allergy,

1061
01:24:59.344 --> 01:25:02.598
and they gave me a list of things
to stay away from and...

1062
01:25:06.226 --> 01:25:07.569
I was...

1063
01:25:08.270 --> 01:25:11.240
I was so sure it was something else.

1064
01:25:21.408 --> 01:25:23.661
I love you, Maddy.

1065
01:25:28.040 --> 01:25:30.668
And I hope you still love me.

1066
01:25:34.504 --> 01:25:36.256
I'm so sorry.

1067
01:25:37.549 --> 01:25:38.766
<font color="#FA6745">(SNIFFLES)</font>

1068
01:25:47.351 --> 01:25:48.568
<font color="#FA6745">(SHUDDERING)</font>

1069
01:25:55.359 --> 01:25:56.611
<font color="#FA6745">(CRYING SOFTLY)</font>

1070
01:26:02.908 --> 01:26:04.535
<font color="#FA6745">(BREATHING SHAKILY)</font>

1071
01:26:07.162 --> 01:26:11.042
<font color="#ff8000">MADDY</font> : <font color="#FFFF00"><i>The universe already took
my dad and brother away from my mom.</i></font>

1072
01:26:12.751 --> 01:26:15.095
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>She was afraid to lose me, too.</i></font>

1073
01:26:15.462 --> 01:26:18.932
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>So she made herself
believe that I was sick.</i></font>

1074
01:26:21.551 --> 01:26:25.647
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I can understand how she felt. Almost.</i></font>

1075
01:26:26.515 --> 01:26:28.108
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I'm trying to.</i></font>

1076
01:26:30.686 --> 01:26:32.688
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>My mother loved my father.</i></font>

1077
01:26:36.983 --> 01:26:39.281
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>He was the love of her life.</i></font>

1078
01:26:40.612 --> 01:26:42.740
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>And she loved my brother.</i></font>

1079
01:26:43.657 --> 01:26:46.126
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>He was the love of her life.</i></font>

1080
01:26:47.369 --> 01:26:49.371
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>And she loves me.</i></font>

1081
01:26:50.414 --> 01:26:52.758
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I am the love of her life.</i></font>

1082
01:26:55.127 --> 01:26:57.004
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I want to forgive her.</i></font>

1083
01:26:58.296 --> 01:27:03.143
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>But right now, all I can think about
is everything I've missed.</i></font>

1084
01:27:11.309 --> 01:27:13.437
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>I've been trying to find
the single moment</i></font>

1085
01:27:13.645 --> 01:27:15.989
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>that set my life on its path.</i></font>

1086
01:27:16.773 --> 01:27:19.401
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Maybe there's a version of my life
where I'm sick.</i></font>

1087
01:27:20.485 --> 01:27:22.487
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>A version where I die in Hawaii.</i></font>

1088
01:27:23.780 --> 01:27:28.206
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Another where my father and brother are
still alive and my mother's not broken.</i></font>

1089
01:27:30.370 --> 01:27:32.793
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>There's even a version
of my life without Olly in it.</i></font>

1090
01:27:34.166 --> 01:27:35.543
<font color="#FA6745">(INDISTINCT CHATTERING)</font>

1091
01:28:41.441 --> 01:28:42.533
Hi.

1092
01:28:43.860 --> 01:28:44.907
Hey.

1093
01:28:47.447 --> 01:28:48.448
<font color="#FFFF00"><i>Do you ever wonder</i></font>

1094
01:28:48.740 --> 01:28:51.260
what your life would be like
if you could just change one thing?

1095
01:28:51.451 --> 01:28:54.625
What if changing one thing
made things worse?

1096
01:28:55.247 --> 01:28:56.794
What if we hadn't met?

1097
01:28:57.332 --> 01:28:58.709
But we did.

1098
01:28:59.459 --> 01:29:00.676
We did.

1099
01:29:06.424 --> 01:29:08.643
I'm sorry that I didn't say goodbye.

1100
01:29:10.136 --> 01:29:12.264
Are you sure you should be here?

1101
01:29:14.015 --> 01:29:15.688
Probably not. <font color="#FA6745">(CHUCKLES)</font>

1102
01:29:22.107 --> 01:29:24.826
What if today was the first day
